5. Claude
---------

Coaching text is generated by Anthropic's Claude through the Anthropic API,
using the user's own API key, or by the user pasting a prompt into a Claude app.
ForgeCoach is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

Play-mode code adapted from mtg-table
-------------------------------------
src/play/* and src/ui/play/* (the seat session, act builders, the ask dialog
model) adapt behaviour and code from mtg-table's web/src (transport/ws.ts,
render/AskModal.tsx, render/picker.ts, keys.ts), GPL-3.0-or-later, with their
copyright lines kept. src/ui/play/askFixtures.json and src/play/testdata/ hold
asks and frames recorded by mtg-table's fixture corpus.
